<title>UK: Royal &amp; Sun continues share buyback - traders.</title>
<headline>Royal &amp; Sun continues share buyback - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Group Plc continued its share buyback programme on Thursday, snapping up shares at 465p through brokerage ABN AMRO Hoare Govett, dealers said.</p>
<p>The British composite insurer last week said it would repurchase up to five percent of its shares after it posted its results.</p>
<p>More than 15 million shares were bought 479p on May 20 by ABN AMRO Hoare Govett and Cazenove &amp; Co on behalf of the company.</p>
<p>At 0933 GMT, Royal &amp; Sun shares were off 5p to 465-1/2p.</p>
<p>--Debra Sherman, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
